{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>We have heard.</b> The prophet speaks in the voice of Israel or of the nations." "<b>Ge.</b> Deficient in heh, and it is a foreign word." "<b>Not so are his lies.</b> It will not be so in his deeds, like ותעש בדים (Ezekiel 17:6). Some say it means his thoughts, and לא כן is like כן בנות צלפחד (so the daughters of Zelophehad), and בדיו is like בדיך מתים יחרישו (Job 11:3)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:00.134222130Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}